{"2294430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Fabric of the Mind", "steam_appid": 2294430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/07e4fe77ce87d72c4e33686b0cf7dc99.webp?t=1782414966\" width=784 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/8d5a09475d64d367f2ae0dde375a8a5d.poster.avif?t=1782414966\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/8d5a09475d64d367f2ae0dde375a8a5d.webm?t=1782414966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/8d5a09475d64d367f2ae0dde375a8a5d.mp4?t=1782414966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Fabric of the Mind</i> is an atmospheric platformer where movement is more than a tool - it's how you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't just run and jump... You walk on walls, cling to ceilings and approach every room from any angle you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange, interconnected world filled with puzzles and hostile entities that react to your presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fluid movement, solve clever environmental challenges and uncover the unsettling fragments of a story and reveals your purpose in this world, as well as your final goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/31e36a354be44a1ed42e0e507c38a29c.webp?t=1782414966\" width=514 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/6d2eabd6ce25154ad20390fe7b37bfaf.poster.avif?t=1782414966\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/6d2eabd6ce25154ad20390fe7b37bfaf.webm?t=1782414966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/6d2eabd6ce25154ad20390fe7b37bfaf.mp4?t=1782414966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement is the foundation of everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls, ceilings and corners are all part of the path forward. Wall jumps, double jump and gravity-defying traversal chain together to create a smooth, flowing movement system that rewards precision and creativity. Rooms are built to be approached from multiple angles, so there is never only a single &quot;correct&quot; way through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are woven directly into the environment. Redirect energy, manipulate systems and open new paths. These mechanics are taught and explained with clever and intuitive level design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some threats can be avoided, others have to outrun. Tension comes from timing, positioning and momentun. Constant movement and awareness is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/ef6118250c0f5860ba577c2f542e1308.webp?t=1782414966\" width=757 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/ab9b904dcc8939a6d5272d243f4bb848.poster.avif?t=1782414966\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/ab9b904dcc8939a6d5272d243f4bb848.webm?t=1782414966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/ab9b904dcc8939a6d5272d243f4bb848.mp4?t=1782414966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is quiet, dark and interconnected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the world are <i>Memory Cores</i>, remnants of something that was meant to be sealed away. Piecing them together reveals a chronological timeline of everything that has happened... and your role in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/0d6c9e976b86bdb92197c733448b9070.webp?t=1782414966\" width=572 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dark, forgotten place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone, driven only by something you don't understand. A purpose, an instinct, a final goal. The environment is hostile, oppressive and unwelcoming, yet it carries the weight of immense pain and history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't know why you're here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something insists that you keep moving on...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/9cdc0b1afe34f72fdbc75f9173e54433.webp?t=1782414966\" width=464 height=60 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluent and challenging gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very simple controls for keyboard and controller.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different difficulty options, that can be changed at anytime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calmer puzzle sections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An optional dark story to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interconnected, non-linear world to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 unique areas with new and exciting enemies, mechanics and characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple and readable monochrome artstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brilliant original soundtrack.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/07e4fe77ce87d72c4e33686b0cf7dc99.webp?t=1782414966\" width=784 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/8d5a09475d64d367f2ae0dde375a8a5d.poster.avif?t=1782414966\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/8d5a09475d64d367f2ae0dde375a8a5d.webm?t=1782414966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/8d5a09475d64d367f2ae0dde375a8a5d.mp4?t=1782414966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Fabric of the Mind</i> is an atmospheric platformer where movement is more than a tool - it's how you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't just run and jump... You walk on walls, cling to ceilings and approach every room from any angle you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange, interconnected world filled with puzzles and hostile entities that react to your presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fluid movement, solve clever environmental challenges and uncover the unsettling fragments of a story and reveals your purpose in this world, as well as your final goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/31e36a354be44a1ed42e0e507c38a29c.webp?t=1782414966\" width=514 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/6d2eabd6ce25154ad20390fe7b37bfaf.poster.avif?t=1782414966\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/6d2eabd6ce25154ad20390fe7b37bfaf.webm?t=1782414966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/6d2eabd6ce25154ad20390fe7b37bfaf.mp4?t=1782414966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement is the foundation of everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls, ceilings and corners are all part of the path forward. Wall jumps, double jump and gravity-defying traversal chain together to create a smooth, flowing movement system that rewards precision and creativity. Rooms are built to be approached from multiple angles, so there is never only a single &quot;correct&quot; way through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are woven directly into the environment. Redirect energy, manipulate systems and open new paths. These mechanics are taught and explained with clever and intuitive level design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some threats can be avoided, others have to outrun. Tension comes from timing, positioning and momentun. Constant movement and awareness is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/ef6118250c0f5860ba577c2f542e1308.webp?t=1782414966\" width=757 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/ab9b904dcc8939a6d5272d243f4bb848.poster.avif?t=1782414966\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/ab9b904dcc8939a6d5272d243f4bb848.webm?t=1782414966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/ab9b904dcc8939a6d5272d243f4bb848.mp4?t=1782414966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is quiet, dark and interconnected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the world are <i>Memory Cores</i>, remnants of something that was meant to be sealed away. Piecing them together reveals a chronological timeline of everything that has happened... and your role in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/0d6c9e976b86bdb92197c733448b9070.webp?t=1782414966\" width=572 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dark, forgotten place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone, driven only by something you don't understand. A purpose, an instinct, a final goal. The environment is hostile, oppressive and unwelcoming, yet it carries the weight of immense pain and history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't know why you're here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something insists that you keep moving on...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/extras/9cdc0b1afe34f72fdbc75f9173e54433.webp?t=1782414966\" width=464 height=60 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluent and challenging gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very simple controls for keyboard and controller.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different difficulty options, that can be changed at anytime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calmer puzzle sections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An optional dark story to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interconnected, non-linear world to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 unique areas with new and exciting enemies, mechanics and characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple and readable monochrome artstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brilliant original soundtrack.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The Fabric of the Mind is a fast, atmospheric platformer focused on fluid wall-walking movement, environmental puzzles, and an interconnected world where you uncover a dark, optional story through exploration and environment-driven gameplay.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/380368ed88675715358b559311ce09478b41df59/header.jpg?t=1782414966", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/459fc70af7626170da1c4af18f2620c3de820235/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782414966", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/459fc70af7626170da1c4af18f2620c3de820235/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782414966", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8.1 (or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 4th generation or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 520 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> You should be fine with pretty much anything.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8.1 (or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 4th generation or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 520 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Again, this game should be fine.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© 2026 Jacob Graf. All rights reserved.<br />\r\n\"The Fabric of the Mind\" is the title and trademark of the game by Jacob Graf.", "developers": ["Jacob Graf"], "publishers": ["Cimex"], "demos": [{"appid": 2294440, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 66, "description": "Color Alternatives"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 75, "description": "Keyboard Only Option"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/8f228b395cfd44f14d80446730263a5c43c4bd61/ss_8f228b395cfd44f14d80446730263a5c43c4bd61.600x338.jpg?t=1782414966", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/8f228b395cfd44f14d80446730263a5c43c4bd61/ss_8f228b395cfd44f14d80446730263a5c43c4bd61.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782414966"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/eb585699b95c0f46b60489439c09e816f52f73c4/ss_eb585699b95c0f46b60489439c09e816f52f73c4.600x338.jpg?t=1782414966", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/eb585699b95c0f46b60489439c09e816f52f73c4/ss_eb585699b95c0f46b60489439c09e816f52f73c4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782414966"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/e40707cc7ef233c3e3b914ec02a7efe10ca3cc71/ss_e40707cc7ef233c3e3b914ec02a7efe10ca3cc71.600x338.jpg?t=1782414966", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/e40707cc7ef233c3e3b914ec02a7efe10ca3cc71/ss_e40707cc7ef233c3e3b914ec02a7efe10ca3cc71.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782414966"}, {"id": 3, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294430/a21c8ff93ff771c39917d810178784d7b29976d9/ss_a21c8ff93ff771c39917d810178784d7b29976d9.600x338.jpg?t=1782414966", "path_full": "htt